  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Participation, Power and Change: Strengthening Reflective Practice for Equitable Development, IDS, University of Sussex. Aim: Contribute to reduced poverty. How: By shifting power relations in favour of poor people in the South, through strengthening the capacities of development actors for reflection, understanding and action that can help them understand and change power relations.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Participation, Power and Change: Strengthening Reflective Practice for Equitable Development, IDS, University of Sussex. Syfte: bidra till fattigdomsminskning. Hur: p&#xe5;verka maktrelationer till f&#xf6;rdel f&#xf6;r fattiga &amp; marginaliserade m&#xe4;nniskor i Syd genom &#xf6;kad kapacitet hos akt&#xf6;rer inom bist&#xe5;ndet f&#xf6;r reflektion, l&#xe4;rande och praktiskt handlande som kan hj&#xe4;lpa dem att f&#xf6;rst&#xe5; och f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndra maktrelationer.</narrative>
  </description>
